' ============================================================
' CROSS-LAYER RELATIONSHIPS
' ============================================================

' Controller → Model
CircuitController --> CircuitModel : owns & mutates

' Canvas → Controller (Observer)
CircuitCanvasView --> CircuitController : registers as observer

' Canvas → Pathfinder
WireGraphicsItem ..> IDAStarPathfinder : lazy import for routing
_ComponentAdapter ..> IDAStarPathfinder : obstacle data
_WireAdapter ..> IDAStarPathfinder : obstacle data

' Theme usage
CircuitCanvasView ..> ThemeManager : colors, pens, fonts
ComponentGraphicsItem ..> ThemeManager : component colors
WireGraphicsItem ..> ThemeManager : wire colors
AnnotationItem ..> ThemeManager : text colors
ThemeController --> ThemeManager : manages

' Simulation flow
SimulationController --> CircuitModel : reads for netlist

' Services → GUI (report pipeline)
ReportDialog ..> ReportConfig : collects
ReportDataBuilder ..> SimulationController : reads
PDFReportRenderer ..> ReportData : renders

' Scripting API
Circuit ..> CircuitController : wraps
Circuit ..> SimulationController : wraps

' Utils usage
FileController ..> atomic_write : crash-safe saves
CircuitController ..> connectivity : floating terminals
SimulationController ..> SpiceSanitizer : sanitizes values
MainWindow ..> drag_drop_router : file drop handling
PropertiesPanel ..> format_utils : value display

